00:00:06.613 --> 00:00:08.280
ANKIT MEHTA: I wanted
to set the context

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.500
with what are the
three key things we're

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.340
going to talk about.

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:18.050
What is engineering
productivity and what are we

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:21.710
doing to make high-quality
software development easier

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:22.280
